#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:56
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:62
msgid "This section covers the question and answer pages of the site. Review it after changing the settings of easyQ, as it describes them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:63
msgid "When you ask a question, write an answer or a comment, vote, or flag a post, we store it with your user account. Questions, answers and comments are public and show your user name and profile picture. Votes and flags are stored so that each counts only once; who cast them is visible only to the moderators of the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:65
msgid "To prevent abuse, we also store the IP address from which a post was written or last changed, shortened by its last part."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:66
msgid "To prevent abuse, we also store the IP address from which a post was written or last changed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:69
msgid "If you post without an account, we store the name you enter, if any, and your email address only if you ask to be notified of answers or comments."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:72
msgid "If you have an account, your profile on the question and answer pages shows your user name, your points, your activity and the profile fields you fill in."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:74
msgid "A profile picture you upload is stored in the media library of the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:79
msgid "When you register, we store the time at which you accepted our terms and the text you accepted, as proof of your consent. This record stays with your user account as long as it exists."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:84
msgid "Private messages are sent to the recipient by email and stored until the sender and the recipient have deleted them; only they can see them. You can choose in your account not to receive private messages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:85
msgid "Private messages are sent to the recipient by email and not stored on the site. You can choose in your account not to receive private messages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:88
msgid "Posts on the wall of a profile are public."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:91
msgid "We send you emails about answers and comments on your posts only if you ask for them; each of these emails contains a link to turn them off."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:94
msgid "If you subscribe to our newsletter, you confirm the subscription with a link we send to your email address, and we store the time of your consent. You can unsubscribe at any time with the link in each newsletter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:97
msgid "If you send us a message with the feedback form, we receive it by email together with your name, your email address and your IP address. It is not stored on the site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:100
msgid "Cookies on the question and answer pages"
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:102
msgid "If you post without an account, we set a cookie that lets you edit your posts later. It contains a random number and lasts for one year."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:104
msgid "If you log in on a question and answer page or close the notice for new visitors, we set a cookie so that the notice is not shown again. It contains no personal data and lasts for ten years."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:105
msgid "Views of questions are counted without cookies and without storing your IP address."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:107
msgid "How long we keep the data of the question and answer pages"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: Number of days.
#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:110
#, php-format
msgid "Questions, answers, comments, votes and profiles are kept until they are deleted. IP addresses are deleted after %d day; those counted to limit how often an action can be performed, after one hour."
msgid_plural "Questions, answers, comments, votes and profiles are kept until they are deleted. IP addresses are deleted after %d days; those counted to limit how often an action can be performed, after one hour."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:119
msgid "Your data on the question and answer pages"
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:120
msgid "If you request an export of your personal data, it includes your questions, answers, comments, votes, flags and your profile on the question and answer pages."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:122
msgid "If you request the erasure of your personal data, your questions, answers and comments are deleted; those others have replied to stay without your name and with shortened IP addresses. Your votes, flags, profile fields and uploaded profile picture are deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/privacy/class-policy-text.php:123
msgid "If you request the erasure of your personal data, your questions, answers and comments stay without your name and with shortened IP addresses. Your votes, flags, profile fields and uploaded profile picture are deleted."
msgstr ""

